// 0.12 备份格式 v3：图片（头像 / 聊天图片）跟着备份走，以及它的上限与坏数据提醒。
"哪些东西跟着走，哪些不跟" = "What travels with him, and what doesn't";
"头像和聊天图片会跟着备份走：图片二进制就装在 JSON 里，换台手机也能照着接回来。代价是备份文件会变大，所以有上限——单张最多 8 MB，全部图片合计最多 128 MB（小内存机型会更少）；超出上限的那几张不会进备份，导出之后会告诉你跳过了几张。" = "Avatars and chat pictures travel with the backup: the image bytes live inside the JSON, so they come back on a new phone. The cost is a bigger file, so there are limits — up to 8 MB per picture and 128 MB in total (less on phones with little memory). Pictures over the limit are left out, and you'll be told how many after exporting.";
"备份里图片有上限：单张 8 MB、全部合计 128 MB，整份备份最大 256 MB；可用内存较小的时候会自动收紧。" = "Pictures in a backup are capped: 8 MB each, 128 MB in total, and 256 MB for the whole file; the caps tighten automatically on devices with little memory.";
"备份里的头像与聊天图片会一起接回来；更早的备份（v2 及以前）里没有图片本体，那些带图片的消息只会剩下文字。" = "Avatars and chat pictures in this backup will come back too. Older backups (v2 and earlier) never carried the image bytes, so those messages keep only their text.";
"有 %d 张图片没有随备份带走（超出上限）" = "%d pictures weren't included in the backup (over the size limit)";
"有 %d 张图片没有随备份带走（超出上限）.one" = "%d picture wasn't included in the backup (over the size limit)";
"有 %d 张图片没接回来（文件损坏或格式不支持）" = "%d pictures couldn't be restored (damaged file or unsupported format)";
"有 %d 张图片没接回来（文件损坏或格式不支持）.one" = "%d picture couldn't be restored (damaged file or unsupported format)";
"有 %d 张图片没有接回来（超出上限）" = "%d pictures weren't restored (over the size limit)";
"有 %d 张图片没有接回来（超出上限）.one" = "%d picture wasn't restored (over the size limit)";
"媒体" = "Media";

